msgid "MySQL Emoji Support (utf8mb4)"
msgstr "MySQL Emoji-støtte (utf8mb4)"

#: CRM/Utils/Check/Component/Env.php
msgid ""
"It is recommended, though not yet required, to upgrade your PHP MySQL driver"
" (mysqlnd) to >= 5.0.9 for utf8mb4 support."
msgstr "Det anbefales, men er ennå ikke påkrevd, å oppgradere PHPs MySQL-driver (mysqlnd) til >= 5.0.9 for støtte for utf8mb4."

#: CRM/Utils/Check/Component/Env.php
msgid "PHP MySQL Driver (mysqlnd)"
msgstr "PHPs MySQL-driver (mysqlnd)"

#: CRM/Utils/Check/Component/Env.php
msgid ""
"It is recommended, though not yet required, to upgrade your PHP MySQL driver"
" (libmysqlclient) to >= 5.5.3 for utf8mb4 support."
msgstr "Det anbefales, men er ennå ikke påkrevd, å oppgradere PHPs MySQL-driver (libmysqlclient) til >= 5.5.3 for støtte for utf8mb4."

#: CRM/Utils/Check/Component/Env.php
msgid "PHP MySQL Driver (libmysqlclient)"
msgstr "PHPs MySQL-driver (libmysqlclient)"

#: CRM/Utils/Check/Component/Env.php
msgid ""
"To prepare for CiviCRM v%4, please upgrade MySQL. The recommended version "
